{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34418","headline":"奉和袭美寄滑州李副使员外 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美寄滑州李副使员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛生闲咏正抽毫，忽傍旌旗着战袍。\n檄下连营皆破胆，劒离孤匣欲吹毛。\n清秋月色临军垒，半夜淮声入贼壕。\n除却征南爲上将，平徐功业更谁高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}